    {
      "id": "d0232c251b4011b26d61003e8ad477fb2f5c2246",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1303093704,
          "type": null,
          "body": "For the record: for faster linking times, in 2019 I changed the linker to Gold and later LLD using this command: \n```\n$ cmake -GNinja .. -DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=clang -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=clang++ -DCMAKE_C_FLAGS=-fuse-ld=lld -DCMAKE_CXX_FLAGS=-fuse-ld=lld ..\n```\nHowever now I am seeing this warning, presumably after this change:\n```\nclang-15: warning: argument unused during compilation: '-fuse-ld=lld' [-Wunused-command-line-argument]\n```\nFrom `clang -help`:\n```\n  -Qunused-arguments      Don't emit warning for unused driver arguments\n```\n\nInterestingly, this also causes the internal `WERROR` test to fail since `-Werror -fuse-ld=lld` results in `clang-15: warning: argument unused during compilation: '-fuse-ld=lld' [-Wunused-command-line-argument]`\n\nSetting `-DCMAKE_LINKER=ld.lld` initially appears to do something. Note that `-DCMAKE_LINKER=lld` is not sufficient, some checks (such as the one for `_CMAKE_LINKER_PUSHPOP_STATE_SUPPORTED` in `Modules/Platform/Linux.cmake`) check the `\"${CMAKE_LINKER}\" --help` output which differs between `ld.lld` and `lld`.\n\nHowever, inspecting `ninja -n` and `ninja -v` shows that the last command (`Linking CXX executable run/wireshark`) still uses `clang++`. Somewhat verbose, but solving the problem is setting:\n```\n-DCMAKE_{EXE,SHARED,MODULE}_LINKER_FLAGS=-fuse-ld=lld\n```\n(`EXE` is for `run/wireshark`, SHARED for `libwireshark.so`, `MODULE` is for plugins. `STATIC` is deliberatedly excluded since `llvm-ar` is already in use to link `run/libiface_monitor.a` for example.)",
          "author": {
            "id": 2415432,
            "username": "Lekensteyn",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Peter Wu",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/efcf30db53f30b15e7c905ef37bd4dc44d87573bd92baf97cd707115d3fcd0c0?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/Lekensteyn"
          },
          "created_at": "2023-03-06T22:55:44.713Z",
          "updated_at": "2023-03-11T15:10:49.227Z",
